 R←Test_SendEmail_54(stopFlag batchFlag);⎕IO;⎕ML;⎕TRAP;cp;connection;rc;msg;config;message
⍝ The methods of `Connection` that `Send` does not need: `Ping` before connecting, `Logon`, `Reset`, `Config`,
⍝ `ConnectionParms` and `Logoff`; and `Message.Config`
 ⎕IO←1 ⋄ ⎕ML←1
 ⎕TRAP←(999 'C' '. ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')
 R←T._Failed

 ∆SERVER.Defaults
 ∆SERVER.Clear
 cp←∆NewParms
 connection←⎕NEW SMTP.Connection(,⊂cp)
 (rc msg)←connection.Ping
 →T.PassesIf 1=rc
 →T.PassesIf'555 SMTP server not connected'≡29↑msg
 →T.PassesIf cp≡connection.ConnectionParms
 (rc msg)←connection.Logon
 →T.PassesIf 0=rc
 →T.PassesIf connection.LoggedOn
 →T.PassesIf 1=≢∆SERVER.Logons
 (rc msg)←connection.Reset
 →T.PassesIf 0=rc
 →T.PassesIf'RSET'≡⊃⌽∆SERVER.Commands
 config←connection.Config
 →T.PassesIf 2=≢⍴config
 →T.PassesIf(⊂'CongaRootName')∊config[;1]
 (rc msg)←connection.Logoff
 →T.PassesIf 0=rc
 →T.PassesIf~connection.LoggedOn
 →T.PassesIf~⊃connection.Connected
 message←⎕NEW SMTP.Message(⍬ cp(∆NewMail'Config'))
 config←message.Config
 →T.PassesIf 2=≢⍴config
 →T.PassesIf(⊂'Text')∊config[;1]

 R←T._OK
⍝Done
